# All doc content images must be referenced via external CDN links, not committed as binaries.
# Only site theme assets (logo, favicon, etc. under docs/images and docs/stylesheets) are allowed.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.webp
*.svg
*.ico
*.tif
*.tiff
!**/docs/images/**
!**/docs/stylesheets/**
